{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"本日は名古屋個握に\n来てくださったみなさん\n本当にありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2013/09/30/6681297/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいちゅんヽ(｡･ω･｡)ﾉ♡\n優しいお姉さんっ☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また握手会が終わってから\n元気になり過ぎてテンション\n高めの真夏です(`･v･´)ゞ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いま全然眠くないから\n明日学校で寝ちゃいそうな気が...笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"常連さんもお久しぶりさんも\nはじめましてさんも会えて\nめっちゃ嬉しかったぁ∩^ω^∩"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当......大好き。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"会うたびに好きに\nなっちゃうじゃんかぁーっ////♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まったくもぅっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゃあ私服紹介〜(ﾉ･v･)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1,4部"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2013/09/30/6681297/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ニットワンピ/minplume\n靴/RANDA"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ヘアは\n1部:巻きおろし\n4部:巻きハーフツイン"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2,3部"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2013/09/30/6681297/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"パジャマ/ピーチジョン"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お家